# Scopes what EAS Build uploads for the mobile app.
# Without this, `eas build` archives the entire monorepo (git root), not just
# apps/mobile/ -- including apps/ml's untracked model/dataset files and the
# root .venv, neither of which is covered by .gitignore. That bloated a build
# to 670MB and is the likely cause of an unexplained cloud Gradle failure.
# apps/mobile is fully self-contained (own package.json/lockfile), so none of
# this is needed to build it.

apps/backend
apps/web
apps/ml
deploy
Docs
graphify-out
.venv
.next
*.docx
*.pptx

# Local Android build/tooling caches -- Android Studio keeps live file locks
# on these while it's open, which crashes the "Compressing project files"
# step with EBUSY on Windows. They're gitignored already and fully disposable.
apps/mobile/android/.gradle
apps/mobile/android/.cxx
apps/mobile/android/build
apps/mobile/android/app/.cxx
apps/mobile/android/app/build
